					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/noname2006" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5256394); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5256394&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606053748" alt="NoName2006" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5256394)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/noname2006" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5256394); return false;" >NoName2006</a></span> <span class="odate time_1606048714 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">22 Nov 2020 12:38</span>
