			<div class="content" id="post-content-4825442">
									

<p>Seeking Greenlights: Yes</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: An anomalous substance with properties similiar to petroleum.</p>
<p>Central Narrative: The Axis Powers suffered a <strong>major</strong> oil shortage all throught the war, therefore they try to develop and mass produce a synthetic substance through anomalous means to act as a replacement for oil.</p>
<p>Hooks: Having the Axis use anomalies to fix a very real problem they had. Also I wanted to come up with a paratech article that wasn't just a weapon.</p>
<p>Additional Notes:<br />
1)I would like some advice on how to make believeable Memos.<br />
2)Before any asks: <strong>I AM NOT A NAZI OR A FASCIST OR ANYTHING SIMILIAR</strong></p>

